msgstr "Ejemplo"

#: src/formatimporter.cpp:108
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Folder mirroring is not possible anymore (see <a href='https://basket-"
"notepads.github.io'>basket-notepads.github.io</a> for more information).</"
"p><p>The folder <b>%1</b> has been copied for the basket needs. You can "
"either delete this folder or delete the basket, or use both. But remember "
"that modifying one will not modify the other anymore as they are now "
"separate entities.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>El replicado de carpetas ya no es posible (vea <a href='https://basket-"
"notepads.github.io'>basket-notepads.github.io</a> para más información). </"
"p><p>La carpeta <b>%1</b> ha sido copiada para las necesidades de la cesta. "
"Puede borrar esta carpeta o la cesta, o utilizar ambas. Pero recuerde que "
"modificar una no modificará la otra, puesto que ahora son dos entidades "
"separadas.</p>"

